{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"403ec3737a75853134b086721bd2c415","RawContent":"I&#039;m in trouble then... the dress models are all 6&#039; and 95lbs... I love the slimmer, form-fitting dresses too.\n I plan to go barefoot, am 5&#039;4&amp;quot;, athletic 125lbs.&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/muscle.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Muscle\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; \n Maybe I&#039;ll do the bikini and sarong thing. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thatswck.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"that&#039;s wack\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":23091,"PostDate":1170446344,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm in trouble then... the dress models are all 6' and 95lbs... I love the slimmer, form-fitting dresses too.<br \/> I plan to go barefoot, am 5'4\", athletic 125lbs.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/muscle.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Muscle\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <br \/> Maybe I'll do the bikini and sarong thing. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thatswck.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"that's wack\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;125\/st\/20070401\/e\/engagement%3F%3F%3F\/dt\/-2\/k\/1104\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...1104\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"llbourassa@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1169411696,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207085.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lbourassa","Id":207085,"Name":"lbourassa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae236be84446a216ae532762f835aedc","RawContent":"You girls are all gorgeous!! I like the &amp;quot;real girl&amp;quot; pics WAY more than the model pics. The models all look so uptight and overdone....and there&#039;s just nothing like the look of a bride in HER dress. \n \n Also, you all have great taste! I&#039;ve loved looking at all your dress choices...it &lt;u&gt;almost&lt;\/u&gt; makes me wish I could go dress shopping again! I seriously only tried on 3 dresses before I decided on one! Nice that I didn&#039;t have to agonize over it...kind of a bummer &#039;cause I didn&#039;t try very many styles and have more &amp;quot;dress expericence&amp;quot; \n \n I love wedding dresses...","Attachments":[],"Id":23095,"PostDate":1170446833,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You girls are all gorgeous!! I like the \"real girl\" pics WAY more than the model pics. The models all look so uptight and overdone....and there's just nothing like the look of a bride in HER dress. <br \/> <br \/> Also, you all have great taste! I've loved looking at all your dress choices...it <u>almost<\/u> makes me wish I could go dress shopping again! I seriously only tried on 3 dresses before I decided on one! Nice that I didn't have to agonize over it...kind of a bummer 'cause I didn't try very many styles and have more \"dress expericence\" <br \/> <br \/> I love wedding dresses...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/lb2f.lilypie.com\/x9V9m5.png\">http:\/\/lb2f.lilypie.com\/x9V9m5.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.thebump.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt4be13.aspx\">http:\/\/global.thebump.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt4be13.aspx<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rachelle.p.edwards@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1168544820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207054.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Rachelle E.","Id":207054,"Name":"Rachelle E.","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason