{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":797,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1661988,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":250082,"Name":"ElleGee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250082.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1347366477,"LastPoster":{"Id":282827,"Name":"WeddingDayStory","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282827.jpg?_r=1431453768","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1661988,"PostDate":1347366477,"PostContent":"Hi ladies!! My wedding is just under two months out, and I am just learning about the rules in r...","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">- Elle Gee<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">(Laura)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Visit my online boutique: www.candiwithellegee.com<\/span>","Email":"lauragoldstein24@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.231.32.152","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1326852380,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250082.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ElleGee","Id":250082,"Name":"ElleGee","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69400,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3450427a078782474e2aaca5ee0fb57","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies!! My wedding is just under two months out, and I am just learning about the rules in regards to bringing STARFISH into Mexico. We are flying into the Cancun airport and I have made my own napkin rings and escort cards with the white 3&#039; &amp;nbsp;finger starfish. Can someone please give me some advice on their experience on bringing these items into Mexico. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I had read if they are replicas, it is not as big of a deal . . .SADLY, I dont even know if mine are replicas or real. I am pretty sure they are not real though.I attatched a photo also. PLEASE HELP!! THANK YOU!&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"162212\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/162212\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1661988,"PostDate":1347366477,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies!! My wedding is just under two months out, and I am just learning about the rules in regards to bringing STARFISH into Mexico. We are flying into the Cancun airport and I have made my own napkin rings and escort cards with the white 3' \u00a0finger starfish. Can someone please give me some advice on their experience on bringing these items into Mexico. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I had read if they are replicas, it is not as big of a deal . . .SADLY, I dont even know if mine are replicas or real. I am pretty sure they are not real though.I attatched a photo also. PLEASE HELP!! THANK YOU!<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"162212\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/162212\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">- Elle Gee<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">(Laura)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Visit my online boutique: www.candiwithellegee.com<\/span>","Email":"lauragoldstein24@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.231.32.152","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1326852380,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250082.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ElleGee","Id":250082,"Name":"ElleGee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69400,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0e9970c928f73668dfa438555cfd074","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Relax! I used tons of real, dried out starfish and did not have any problem bringing them into Mexico. If the starfish were alive (which they are obviously not), that would be the issue, but since they are properly dried out, you shouldnt have any trouble at all. Mexico is mainly worried about there being live organisms on the starfish.\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1662008,"PostDate":1347372811,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Relax! I used tons of real, dried out starfish and did not have any problem bringing them into Mexico. If the starfish were alive (which they are obviously not), that would be the issue, but since they are properly dried out, you shouldnt have any trouble at all. Mexico is mainly worried about there being live organisms on the starfish.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=HTML&utm_campaign=tickers\"><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nikki.wolfert@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.197.16.191","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1313460961,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243941.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":207,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TheWolferts","Id":243941,"Name":"TheWolferts","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69400,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46417787ec8420d20e8815d56a50a980","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats lolaTX and welcome to the forum! wishing you all the best with your wedding and good times ahead.....enjoy :)&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"162251\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/162251\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1662048,"PostDate":1347376931,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats lolaTX and welcome to the forum! wishing you all the best with your wedding and good times ahead.....enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"162251\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/162251\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.185.71.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69400,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"109e4ef80357ccedc7272bd07896ed57","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi BDW forum!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Though we are sure OP already took care of the starfish issue since it&#039;s over 4 years old, we wanted to leave this helpful link here for future brides going trough the same starfish-related dilema!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/2016\/03\/08\/3957\/beach-wedding-diy-projects\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/2016\/03\/08\/3957\/beach-wedding-diy-projects\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Among those DIY projects, you&#039;ll find a link with instructions to make your own starfish.. They look virtually the same as the real ones, you&#039;ll have no issues with flying them whatsoever... and, most importantly, you won&#039;t be disrupting any eco-system by using starfish in your wedding decorations :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914270,"PostDate":1465413363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi BDW forum!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Though we are sure OP already took care of the starfish issue since it's over 4 years old, we wanted to leave this helpful link here for future brides going trough the same starfish-related dilema!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/2016\/03\/08\/3957\/beach-wedding-diy-projects\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingda...g-diy-projects\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Among those DIY projects, you'll find a link with instructions to make your own starfish.. They look virtually the same as the real ones, you'll have no issues with flying them whatsoever... and, most importantly, you won't be disrupting any eco-system by using starfish in your wedding decorations <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning everyone!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:15px;\">The WeddingDayStory Family<\/span> <\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><em>Celebrating the Simple Romance of Weddings in the Sun<\/em><\/p>\n<p>\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Office (MX): +52 984 148 8653 \u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Skype: WeddingDayStoryPhotoVideo<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\">Let's connect! \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/weddingdaystory'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci6.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/TMeXMn22qXFltX6DJDe_AEo_GCBXvZ0lfEoQ1N-sDj8MqXTEyHVSyjBY3N6gvfGOnEulCpGxzXZijcD_pU6C2X1YwSBuk1iBYjtSYRjFV3wTTKLSAQQj6Z2vAfG6_em0493VUojBKC0uQUVBLAM=s0-d-e1-ft#https:\/\/cdn3.iconfinder.com\/data\/icons\/free-social-icons\/67\/facebook_circle_color-20.png\" alt=\"facebook_circle_color-20.png\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.instagram.com\/weddingdaystory'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/RWS9rjXymObP14zt_LiPSHwXQ3uPcgwH6AZT7qPuCu0Ka8ysDJENgx1lJiGofIj0aAIXDJgoZO9_6D1VvySkdovgOObcxndByrFDGd3aZ-7l2U9bYuo6e72ceD-8sM3fL7FT3Vxo9TciI2a