weekend stating that she will no longer be the coordinator. The new coordinator is Maria. I have not spoken with her yet, but hope to touch base with her later this week - her e-mail is...mgarcia@cabodelsol.com.mx\n If you would like the menu prices send me a pm with your e-mail address and I would be happy to pass them along. Good Luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":898666,"PostDate":1256567083,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Kiwibride, <br \/> Unfortunately I got an e-mail from Ana this weekend stating that she will no longer be the coordinator. The new coordinator is Maria. I have not spoken with her yet, but hope to touch base with her later this week - her e-mail is...mgarcia@cabodelsol.com.mx<br \/> If you would like the menu prices send me a pm with your e-mail address and I would be happy to pass them along. Good Luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"doniejordan@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1236260461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215508.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":208,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Donie Jordan","Id":215508,"Name":"Donie Jordan","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":28,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
