"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.5.56.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77516,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c0b172401f2e6cb306c8e3cb50cc150b","RawContent":"Congratulations!","Attachments":[],"Id":1869423,"PostDate":1409165459,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congratulations! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spj.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407336954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279330.jpg?_r=1407431220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"spjwedding","Id":279330,"Name":"spjwedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.105.98.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77516,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2ee1fdcb44ecbb25e9277fd15e704bf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Did all of your guests stay at the Riu Palace?&amp;nbsp; I am looking into doing our wedding there, however I know it can be pricey and I don&#039;t want my guests to be stressed by the pricing.&amp;nbsp; I like the idea that they can stay right next store at the Riu Santa Fe (I&#039;ve stayed there before and it&#039;s awesome as well).&amp;nbsp; However, I&#039;m concerned that most people may opt to stay there and I&#039;ll have to pay an additional fee for so many people to be at the Palace that day.&amp;nbsp; Thanks for the input! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869619,"PostDate":1409244654,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Did all of your guests stay at the Riu Palace?\u00a0 I am looking into doing our wedding there, however I know it can be pricey and I don't want my guests to be stressed by the pricing.\u00a0 I like the idea that they can stay right next store at the Riu Santa Fe (I've stayed there before and it's awesome as well).\u00a0 However, I'm concerned that most people may opt to stay there and I'll have to pay an additional fee for so many people to be at the Palace that day.\u00a0 Thanks for the input! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jasminearceo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.105.98.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398959405,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277804.jpg?_r=1416936614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jazzzy23","Id":277804,"Name":"jazzzy23","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77516","Title":"Just Married At The Riu Palace Cabo 6\/27\/14 With Pictures","LastPostDate":1431706724},"Pages":{"TotalItems":16,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
