{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.67.117.232","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77516,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e040073f2ce7c610bbf04081aa9066f2","RawContent":"Thank you all for the sweet comments!! It really was the wedding of our dreams [emoji173]\ufe0f[emoji173]\ufe0f \n\n\n@[member=\"jazzzy23\"] all of our guests stayed at the palace except 2 moved to the Santa Fe for the last 2 nights and they seemed to have enjoyed it!! We had a travel agent that allowed our guests to have a payment plan so no one was forced to pay all of it at once which really helped our guests! The fee to get them to the Palace for the wedding is going to get pricey!  We didn&#039;t even give our guest the option of staying somewhere else and no one asked about staying anywhere else. They were very understanding that this was our wedding and they were going to do what we wanted without question which was so great of them!  Hope this helps!!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1869670,"PostDate":1409265846,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you all for the sweet comments!! It really was the wedding of our dreams [emoji173]\ufe0f[emoji173]\ufe0f <br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277804\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277804-jazzzy23\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jazzzy23<\/span><\/a> all of our guests stayed at the palace except 2 moved to the Santa Fe for the last 2 nights and they seemed to have enjoyed it!! We had a travel agent that allowed our guests to have a payment plan so no one was forced to pay all of it at once which really helped our guests! The fee to get them to the Palace for the wedding is going to get pricey!  We didn't even give our guest the option of staying somewhere else and no one asked about staying anywhere else. They were very understanding that this was our wedding and they were going to do what we wanted without question which was so great of them!  Hope this helps!!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandambeals@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.67.117.232","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399587755,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277904.jpg?_r=1399604134","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"abeals11388","Id":277904,"Name":"abeals11388","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.105.98.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77516,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"27ecc3387eec9d3d63241f5505bcf2b7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"abeals11388\"] Thank you so much for taking the time to answer my questions.&amp;nbsp; You have been very helpful!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870263,"PostDate":1409671252,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277904\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277904-abeals11388\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">abeals11388<\/span><\/a> Thank you so much for taking the time to answer my questions.\u00a0 You have been very helpful!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jasminearceo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.105.98.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398959405,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277804.jpg?_r=1416936614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jazzzy23","Id":277804,"Name":"jazzzy23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77516,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13ccac005de093c0ad1a4d51b5a21a6b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you for the review as I am considering Riu Palace.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877002,"PostDate":1414351893,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you for the review as I am considering Riu Palace.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413941646,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.211.33.245","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77516,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0de20e4bfc2c66885944e870ac515b23","RawContent":"Thanks for your review everything was beautiful I&#039;m a Riu Palace bride for May 2016 and I was wanting information about the dinner cruise that&#039;s something I wanted to do instead of reception if you have more information I would appreciate it","Attachments":[],"Id":1894697,"PostDate":1430220537,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for your review everything was beautiful I'm a Riu Palace bride for May 2016 and I was wanting information about the dinner cruise that's something I wanted to do instead of reception if you have more information I would appreciate it\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bnr2780@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.211.33.245","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419693692,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281492.jpg?_r=1438866306","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"BrandiNR","Id":281492,"Name":"BrandiNR","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77516,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0544c96d76463c1f73dcd5c45ae91a30","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Lovely pictures! &amp;nbsp;Looks like it was perfect weather too!~&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894698,"PostDate":1430220677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Lovely pictures! \u00a0Looks like it was perfect weather too!~<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396968452,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77516,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfcafe6409066d59c9049f989bdf69e6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you for sharing your experience with us. I love that last picture on the sand. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896425,"PostDate":1431706724,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you for sharing your experience with us. I love that last picture on the sand. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Our\u00a0perfect wedding in the Riviera Maya.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Date:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 01\/15\/2015<\/p>\n<p>Resort:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Occidental Grand Xcaret - Riviera Maya, Mexico<br>\nGuests:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a070-80<br>\nPackage:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Custom<\/p>\n<p>Dress:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 David's Bridal<br>\nMinister:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Family Friend<\/p>\n<p>Photographer:\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0Decordova Photography ( <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.decordova.ca'>www.decordova.ca<\/a> )<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"emma.palmer.love@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419930757,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"emmapalmer","Id":281523,"Name":"emmapalmer","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":16,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
