ationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137227820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7289d2557041578c413c89605e5f38de","RawContent":"we brought down a ridiculous amount of stuff including 3 cases of wine. I think as long as you tell them that it&#039;s for a wedding they&#039;re not going to bug you.","Attachments":[],"Id":68027,"PostDate":1182898326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                we brought down a ridiculous amount of stuff including 3 cases of wine. I think as long as you tell them that it's for a wedding they're not going to bug you.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/jimkennedyphotography.com\/movienatasha\/\">3.24.07 cabo surf<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/nabumbah.livejournal.com\/\">year two.<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/20th.teamintraining.org\/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=cpc&utm_campaign=20th%2BAdwords\">i ran 26.2 - I helped save lives.<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v396\/nabumbah\/family157-1.jpg\">http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v3...amily157-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nabumbah@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1147466760,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206733.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":83,"PhotoHeight":99,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NABUMBAH","Id":206733,"Name":"NABUMBAH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4ad861efe3246464c5abad33b109325","RawContent":"I got stopped at Mexico customs. I didn&#039;t even get to press the red\/green light button. They x-rayed my bags and then opened them. They wanted to see all of my receipts for everything. The guy started pulling out his cell phone and adding up my receipts. I didn&#039;t bring all the receipts and when he noticed that each receipt was for 8-10 dollars he let us go. My brother had one of my bags and didn&#039;t have receipts the guy gave him a hard time, but let him through. He had my freeze dried rose petals and those were taken away....can&#039;t bring real petals into the country. \n \n My dad was also asked for receipts. He had my vases and sand ceremony stuff. \n \n You should try to split up your stuff between a few people and make sure they have receipts that don&#039;t total more than $300. \n \n hope this helps. My experience was in Cabo last Monday.","Attachments":[],"Id":68196,"PostDate":1182912604,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I got stopped at Mexico customs. I didn't even get to press the red\/green light button. They x-rayed my bags and then opened them. They wanted to see all of my receipts for everything. The guy started pulling out his cell phone and adding up my receipts. I didn't bring all the receipts and when he noticed that each receipt was for 8-10 dollars he let us go. My brother had one of my bags and didn't have receipts the guy gave him a hard time, but let him through. He had my freeze dried rose petals and those were taken away....can't bring real petals into the country. <br \/> <br \/> My dad was also asked for receipts. He had my vases and sand ceremony stuff. <br \/> <br \/> You should try to split up your stuff between a few people and make sure they have receipts that don't total more than $300. <br \/> <br \/> hope this helps. My experience was in Cabo last Monday.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>My new man....Donovan<\/span><br><br><span>Wedding photos and avatar by Jonathan Thrasher Photography - <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jthrasherphoto.com\">www.jthrasherphoto.com<\/a><br><span>Our wedding slide show <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jthrasherphoto.com\/slideshows\/jessalyn\">www.jthrasherphoto.com\/slideshows\/jessalyn<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/2;54;107\/st\/20090205\/n\/Donovan\/dt\/-3\/k\/27c1\/age.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...k\/27c1\/age.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jessalynj@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1143679800,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206728.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":61,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jessalyn","Id":206728,"Name":"Jessalyn","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"4239","Title":"Customs in Mexico - declaring wedding stuff","LastPostDate":1418405970},"Pages":{"TotalItems":127,"TotalPages":13,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":120},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
