Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87ca4d5d1d0255c1a291cfec303df4c9","RawContent":"Hi Brides:\n \n From what I just read I decided to print in Spanish a paper that I will include in the bags should we need it. Stating that this is not for resale but instead for our wedding.\n \n Secondly, it appears if we get a green light grab the largest of the bags with the most stuff and get out of there quickly. \n \n Have cash on hand. 100.00 and a baggage guy might just get all of our stuff through.\n \n Have all Receipts for each item and make sure they do not exceed 300.00.\n \n Separate bulk items into different suitcases\/and persons as to not trigger suspension of bag...especially as it goes through security.\n \n If any of you have any other ideas please post, especially those more recent brides as I&#039;m sure things change often in Puerto Vallarta customs.\n \n TY....\n \n Today is Sept 11, GOD BLESS THOSE WE LOST.","Attachments":[],"Id":107925,"PostDate":1189549135,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Brides:<br \/> <br \/> From what I just read I decided to print in Spanish a paper that I will include in the bags should we need it. Stating that this is not for resale but instead for our wedding.<br \/> <br \/> Secondly, it appears if we get a green light grab the largest of the bags with the most stuff and get out of there quickly. <br \/> <br \/> Have cash on hand. 100.00 and a baggage guy might just get all of our stuff through.<br \/> <br \/> Have all Receipts for each item and make sure they do not exceed 300.00.<br \/> <br \/> Separate bulk items into different suitcases\/and persons as to not trigger suspension of bag...especially as it goes through security.<br \/> <br \/> If any of you have any other ideas please post, especially those more recent brides as I'm sure things change often in Puerto Vallarta customs.<br \/> <br \/> TY....<br \/> <br \/> Today is Sept 11, GOD BLESS THOSE WE LOST.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Our first year married. We had our marriage blessed at our Catholic Church.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cctexas1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1182200974,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207476.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chrisnessa","Id":207476,"Name":"chrisnessa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c0137fc88450f9fce91a05c1073acc7","RawContent":"We walked right through but we did have my friend bring through one of the bags. Honestly we didnt&#039; have that much stuff and since both of us were carrying a dress\/suit I think it was obvious that it was our wedding...","Attachments":[],"Id":107951,"PostDate":1189552731,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We walked right through but we did have my friend bring through one of the bags. Honestly we didnt' have that much stuff and since both of us were carrying a dress\/suit I think it was obvious that it was our wedding...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kashmira & Dan<\/span><br><span>Happily married since June 16, 2007<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/IMG_0769.jpg\">http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l1...a\/IMG_0769.jpg<\/a><br><span>Our mini-video: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html\">http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html<\/a><br><span>Photo slideshow: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php\">http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"gkashmira@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1156811160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206698.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gkashmira","Id":206698,"Name":"gkashmira","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91c2f8dd04e907cac52196b529c63b17","RawContent":"Kashmira - thank you for the thread. :)\n \n Kate - how did that work getting through customs with that amt of wedding\n inventory?\n \n TY","Attachments":[],"Id":109015,"PostDate":1189711776,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Kashmira - thank you for the thread. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> Kate - how did that work getting through customs with that amt of wedding<br \/> inventory?<br \/> <br \/> TY\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Our first year married. We had our marriage blessed at our Catholic Church.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cctexas1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1182200974,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207476.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chrisnessa","Id":207476,"Name":"chrisnessa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"da3812192636919ab4f878e6263ddbb1","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;chrisnessa&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Kashmira - thank you for the thread. :)\n \n Kate - how did that work getting through customs with that amt of wedding\n inventory?\n \n TY&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;It was fine. We grabbed a dude with a cart and he walked us straight to the xray machine. The guy there asked what was in the boxes and I told him. He also asked how much it was worth - I said $250 and that I had receipts. He didn&#039;t even ask to see them, just said ok. We got the green light and busted through.","Attachments":[],"Id":109023,"PostDate":1189712128,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>chrisnessa<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Kashmira - thank you for the thread. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> Kate - how did that work getting through customs with that amt of wedding<br \/> inventory?<br \/> <br \/> TY<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>It was fine. We grabbed a dude with a cart and he walked us straight to the xray machine. The guy there asked what was in the boxes and I told him. He also asked how much it was worth - I said $250 and that I had receipts. He didn't even ask to see them, just said ok. We got the green light and busted through.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katesig@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.247.242.206","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1154937300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206773.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":85,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"-Kate-","Id":206773,"Name":"-Kate-","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f330fc65bcba0ec8f86da1e3c85b08d6","RawContent":"Ok, i&#039;m nervous about this customs situation. We will be going through Cancun in about 2 weeks. Anyone have any suggestions? We don&#039;t have that much stuff, and we can split it between 6 of us. Any of you do your shopping after you got to Cancun? Medicines and such for OOT bags?\n Anything will help my nerves at this point!\n thanks to all!","Attachments":[],"Id":112305,"PostDate":1190262057,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok, i'm nervous about this customs situation. We will be going through Cancun in about 2 weeks. Anyone have any suggestions? We don't have that much stuff, and we can split it between 6 of us. Any of you do your shopping after you got to Cancun? Medicines and such for OOT bags?<br \/> Anything will help my nerves at this point!<br \/> thanks to all!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Leigh and Bryan<\/span><br><span>October 7th, 2007<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;51;130\/st\/20071007\/e\/OUR+WEDDING+DAY%21\/k\/5da3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...5da3\/event.png<\/a><br><span><a href=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/photobucket.com\">http:\/\/photobucket.com<\/a><span>\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i176.photobucket.com\/albums\/w195\/leighmueller\/mueller4-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i176.photobucket.com\/albums\/w195\/leighmueller\/mueller4-1.jpg<\/a><span>\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Photobucket - Video and Image Hosting\"><\/a><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"leigh_mueller@bellsouth.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1169502720,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207086.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LEIGH","Id":207086,"Name":"LEIGH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a132858409d22330ed3a49509fe6299d","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;LEIGH&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Ok, i&#039;m nervous about this customs situation. We will be going through Cancun in about 2 weeks. Anyone have any suggestions? We don&#039;t have that much stuff, and we can split it between 6 of us. Any of you do your shopping after you got to Cancun? Medicines and such for OOT bags?\n Anything will help my nerves at this point!\n thanks to all!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n I don&#039;t know if this helps you or not, but there is a walmart, costco, and sam&#039;s club in PDC\/Cancun. We went to walmart when we were down there for a site visit and they had everything you could need. The only thing is, you need a car and some time to get it all together!","Attachments":[],"Id":112772,"PostDate":1190337590,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>LEIGH<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Ok, i'm nervous about this customs situation. We will be going through Cancun in about 2 weeks. Anyone have any suggestions? We don't have that much stuff, and we can split it between 6 of us. Any of you do your shopping after you got to Cancun? Medicines and such for OOT bags?<br \/> Anything will help my nerves at this point!<br \/> thanks to all!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> I don't know if this helps you or not, but there is a walmart, costco, and sam's club in PDC\/Cancun. We went to walmart when we were down there for a site visit and they had everything you could need. The only thing is, you need a car and some time to get it all together!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i195.photobucket.com\/albums\/z31\/princezsez\/Wedding2-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i195.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...Wedding2-1.jpg<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;125\/st\/20080525\/e\/I+Marry+My+Best+Friend%21%21%21\/k\/5053\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...5053\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"princezsez@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1180466592,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207427.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":84,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Can'tHardlyWait","Id":207427,"Name":"Can'tHardlyWait","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5df7dcbb8f19fe32967a441ccc210f8c","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;chrisnessa&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi Brides:\n \n From what I just read I decided to print in Spanish a paper that I will include in the bags should we need it. Stating that this is not for resale but instead for our wedding.\n \n Secondly, it appears if we get a green light grab the largest of the bags with the most stuff and get out of there quickly. \n \n Have cash on hand. 100.00 and a baggage guy might just get all of our stuff through.\n \n Have all Receipts for each item and make sure they do not exceed 300.00.\n \n Separate bulk items into different suitcases\/and persons as to not trigger suspension of bag...especially as it goes through security.\n \n If any of you have any other ideas please post, especially those more recent brides as I&#039;m sure things change often in Puerto Vallarta customs.\n \n TY....\n \n Today is Sept 11, GOD BLESS THOSE WE LOST.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi! I like the letter idea written in Spanish.... Do you already have one written? If not, where and how are you going to translate the letter? I&#039;m leaving next week, and think this is a wonderful idea.\n Thanks in advance!","Attachments":[],"Id":117064,"PostDate":1191026761,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>chrisnessa<\/strong> <a href='\/forum\/post\/152720' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi Brides:<br \/> <br \/> From what I just read I decided to print in Spanish a paper that I will include in the bags should we need it. Stating that this is not for resale but instead for our wedding.<br \/> <br \/> Secondly, it appears if we get a green light grab the largest of the bags with the most stuff and get out of there quickly. <br \/> <br \/> Have cash on hand. 100.00 and a baggage guy might just get all of our stuff through.<br \/> <br \/> Have all Receipts for each item and make sure they do not exceed 300.00.<br \/> <br \/> Separate bulk items into different suitcases\/and persons as to not trigger suspension of bag...especially as it goes through security.<br \/> <br \/> If any of you have any other ideas please post, especially those more recent brides as I'm sure things change often in Puerto Vallarta customs.<br \/> <br \/> TY....<br \/> <br \/> Today is Sept 11, GOD BLESS THOSE WE LOST.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi! I like the letter idea written in Spanish.... Do you already have one written? If not, where and how are you going to translate the letter? I'm leaving next week, and think this is a wonderful idea.<br \/> Thanks in advance!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Leigh and Bryan<\/span><br><span>October 7th, 2007<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;51;130\/st\/20071007\/e\/OUR+WEDDING+DAY%21\/k\/5da3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...5da3\/event.png<\/a><br><span><a href=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/photobucket.com\">http:\/\/photobucket.com<\/a><span>\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i176.photobucket.com\/albums\/w195\/leighmueller\/mueller4-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i176.photobucket.com\/albums\/w195\/leighmueller\/mueller4-1.jpg<\/a><span>\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Photobucket - Video and Image Hosting\"><\/a><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"leigh_mueller@bellsouth.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1169502720,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207086.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LEIGH","Id":207086,"Name":"LEIGH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d2574eb07db0ae239dd3a5b48b23252","RawContent":"Keep all your receipts, separate between friends and family members and try to make all your items look as though they are &#039;used&#039; - that is, remove all price tags and stickers. If you bring in an entire suitcase of packaged items, they will assume that you are bringing them into the country to sell for profit and will want to tax you on them.","Attachments":[],"Id":117336,"PostDate":1191101777,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Keep all your receipts, separate between friends and family members and try to make all your items look as though they are 'used' - that is, remove all price tags and stickers. If you bring in an entire suitcase of packaged items, they will assume that you are bringing them into the country to sell for profit and will want to tax you on them.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drlil@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1185406067,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207562.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lavender","Id":207562,"Name":"lavender","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46db72e416bebfcbd35a94a04f643631","RawContent":"Hi this is what I typed on a regular computer letter size paper.\n \n Este art\u00adculos no es para la reventa. Estos art\u00adculos son para el (last name)\n boda.\n \n \n \n These items are not for resale. They are for the (last name) wedding. \n \n \n I have them in every bag items are being packed. If they open our bags this letter will be in there for them to read in Spanish.","Attachments":[],"Id":117456,"PostDate":1191122053,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi this is what I typed on a regular computer letter size paper.<br \/> <br \/> Este art\u00adculos no es para la reventa. Estos art\u00adculos son para el (last name)<br \/> boda.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> These items are not for resale. They are for the (last name) wedding. <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> I have them in every bag items are being packed. If they open our bags this letter will be in there for them to read in Spanish.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Our first year married. We had our marriage blessed at our Catholic Church.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cctexas1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1182200974,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207476.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chrisnessa","Id":207476,"Name":"chrisnessa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4239,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc7ffb42b4b05e978b8bcda89916a6d6","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;chrisnessa&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi this is what I typed on a regular computer letter size paper.\n \n Este art\u00adculos no es para la reventa. Estos art\u00adculos son para el (last name)\n boda.\n \n \n \n These items are not for resale. They are for the (last name) wedding. \n \n \n I have them in every bag items are being packed. If they open our bags this letter will be in there for them to read in Spanish.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;thank you so much!!!!! I am going to print these tomorrow for all of our bags!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":117853,"PostDate":1191216890,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>chrisnessa<\/strong> <a href='\/forum\/post\/165503' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi this is what I typed on a regular computer letter size paper.<br \/> <br \/> Este art\u00c3\u00adculos no es para la reventa. Estos art\u00c3\u00adculos son para el (last name)<br \/> boda.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> These items are not for resale. They are for the (last name) wedding. <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> I have them in every bag items are being packed. If they open our bags this letter will be in there for them to read in Spanish.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>thank you so much!!!!! I am going to print these tomorrow for all of our bags!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Leigh and Bryan<\/span><br><span>October 7th, 2007<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;51;130\/st\/20071007\/e\/OUR+WEDDING+DAY%21\/k\/5da3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...5da3\/event.png<\/a><br><span><a href=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/photobucket.com\">http:\/\/photobucket.com<\/a><span>\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i176.photobucket.com\/albums\/w195\/leighmueller\/mueller4-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i176.photobucket.com\/albums\/w195\/leighmueller\/mueller4-1.jpg<\/a><span>\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Photobucket - Video and Image Hosting\"><\/a><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"leigh_mueller@bellsouth.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1169502720,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207086.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LEIGH","Id":207086,"Name":"LEIGH","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":127,"TotalPages":13,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":120},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
